    title "The debate continues over transgender athletes | 7.30"
    description "Last month,the international swimming governing body FINA effectively banned transgender athletes from competing in women's competitions, sparking a heated debate, and a wave of other sporting bodies reviewing and changing their own policies. Lauren Day looks at the science of balancing fairness and inclusion.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe: http://ab.co/1svxLVE  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABC News provides around the clock coverage of news events as they break in Australia and abroad, including the latest coronavirus pandemic updates. It's news when you want it, from Australia's most trusted news organisation.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more from ABC News, click here: https://ab.co/2kxYCZY&amp;#10;Watch more ABC News content ad-free on iview: https://ab.co/2OB7Mk1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Go deeper on our ABC News In-depth channel: https://ab.co/2lNeBn2&amp;#10;Like ABC News on Facebook: http://facebook.com/abcnews.au&amp;#10;Follow ABC News on Instagram: http://instagram.com/abcnews_au&amp;#10;Follow ABC News on Twitter: http://twitter.com/abcnews&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Note: In most cases, our captions are auto-generated.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#ABCNews #ABCNewsAustralia"
