    label "NT83EVhzSEo"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-23T16:38:52Z"
    title "Ketanji Brown Jackson asked about transgender women in sports during confirmation hearing"
    description "Supreme Court nominee Ketanji Brown Jackson forcefully defended her record as a judge Tuesday, pushing back against Republican assertions that she was soft on crime and declaring she would rule as an &amp;#8220;independent jurist&amp;#8221; if confirmed as the first Black woman on the high court.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In a marathon day of questioning that stretched into the night, Republicans aggressively questioned Ketanji Brown Jackson on the sentences she has handed down to sex offenders in her nine years as a federal judge, her advocacy on behalf of terror suspects at Guantanamo Bay, her thoughts on critical race theory and even her religious views. At one point, Sen. Ted Cruz of Texas read from children's books that he said are taught at her teenage daughter's school.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more on Ketanji Brown Jackson's confirmation hearing, click here: https://bit.ly/3qwgZwV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NEW TO OUR CHANNEL? &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hi! We&amp;#8217;re 10 Tampa Bay, the CBS affiliate serving the Tampa Bay area.  Our team works hard to consider context, pursue connections and identify the trends that shape our worlds. We believe you deserve a return on your invested attention and a reward for your curiosity. And so, we offer storytelling that delves deeper, beyond the noise and confusion, so that you can feel informed, prepared, and connected. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR SOCIAL MEDIA:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/10TampaBay/&amp;#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/10tampabay&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/10tampabay/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NEWS TIPS:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Online: https://www.10TampaBay.com/contact-us&amp;#10;Phone: 727-577-1010&amp;#10;Email: tips@10tampabay.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#10tampabay #localnews #florida"
