    description "Happy Pride Month! All proceeds from this video will be donated to The Marsha P. Johnson Institute - one of the many causes that the WatchMojo Foundation supports thanks to your viewership.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;These transgender characters on TV were trailblazers. Our countdown includes characters from&amp;#34;Pose,&amp;#34; &amp;#34;Glee,&amp;#34; &amp;#34;Euphoria,&amp;#34; and more! Who's YOUR favorite Transgender TV character? Let us know in the comments!&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Watch more great LGBTQ+ videos here: &amp;#13;&amp;#10;Top 10 Inspirational Transgender Celebrities - https://youtu.be/QTMY06jsf2c&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Top 5 Eye Opening Facts About Being Transgender - https://youtu.be/Rt2eNc4KbKk&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Top 10 LGBTQ+ Animated Characters - https://youtu.be/XNBKS2ScY1s&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Have Your Idea Become A Video!&amp;#13;&amp;#10;https://wmojo.com/msmojo-suggest&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Subscribe for more great content!&amp;#13;&amp;#10;https://wmojo.com/msmojo-subscribe&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;MsMojo is a leading producer of reference online video content of Top 10 Lists, Origins, Biographies, Commentary and more on Pop Culture, Celebrity, Movies, Music, TV, Film, Video Games, Politics, News, Comics, Superheroes. Your trusted authority on ranking Pop Culture.&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;#Transgender #LGBTQ+ #Pose"
