  [
    id 165
    label "7Cv-J8KFMNo"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-21T02:30:02Z"
    title "Transgender athletes banned from competing in womens events by international swimming federation"
    description "FINA (F&amp;#233;d&amp;#233;ration internationale de natation), the world governing body of aquatic sports, has adopted a new &amp;#34;gender inclusion policy&amp;#34; that prevents many trans women from competing in women's events. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;FINA says that anyone born male who wants to compete as a woman must exhibit low or suppressed levels of testosterone - a rule already in place in many sports. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In addition, the athletes must have transitioned before the onset of puberty or the age of 12, whichever is later. Redmond Shannon explains what else the organization is proposing, and the backlash to the plan.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more info, please go to https://globalnews.ca/news/8932348/world-swimming-body-transgender-athletes-sports-impact/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to Global News Channel HERE: http://bit.ly/20fcXDc&amp;#10;Like Global News on Facebook HERE: http://bit.ly/255GMJQ&amp;#10;Follow Global News on Twitter HERE: http://bit.ly/1Toz8mt&amp;#10;Follow Global News on Instagram HERE: https://bit.ly/2QZaZIB&amp;#10;#GlobalNews #transgender #swimming"
