    date "2020-06-15T12:00:25Z"
    title "ObGyn: Is Science Anti-Transgender?"
    description "For the duration of Pride, half of all merch revenue will be donated to the BLACK TRANS COALITION. Get yourself an inclusive science shirt. TRANS PRIDE: https://teespring.com/dark-trans-pride-science-is-in?tsmac=store&amp;#38;tsmic=mamadoctorjones&amp;#38;pid=211&amp;#38;cid=103390 RAINBOW PRIDE: https://teespring.com/new-pride-science-is-inclusiv?tsmac=store&amp;#38;tsmic=mamadoctorjones&amp;#38;pid=211&amp;#38;cid=5288 More Options: https://teespring.com/stores/mamadoctorjones&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tweet Me: https://twitter.com/MamaDoctorJones/status/1270216394089660416?s=20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;RESOURCE LIST:&amp;#10;1. Cornell Fact List &amp;#38; Extensive Literature Review: &amp;#10;https://whatweknow.inequality.cornell.edu/topics/lgbt-equality/what-does-the-scholarly-research-say-about-the-well-being-of-transgender-people/&amp;#10;2. GLSEN Terminology Guide: https://www.glsen.org/sites/default/files/Gender%20Terminology%20Guide.pdf&amp;#10;3. Gender Inclusive Language Help: http://lalzimman.com/papers/Zimman2017TransgenderLanguageReform.pdf&amp;#10;4. Importance of Inclusive Providers: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00981389.2016.1193099&amp;#10;5. Tweet Thread from ScienceVet2 Thread on Genetic Sex: https://twitter.com/ScienceVet2/status/1035246030500061184?s=20&amp;#10;6. Supportive Medical Organizations: https://transcendlegal.org/medical-organization-statements&amp;#10;Incidence of Sex Chromosome Abnormalities: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2090319/&amp;#10;7. Mental Health Risks: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1300/J082v51n03_04&amp;#10;8. Hormonal Transition &amp;#38; Mental Health: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/19359705.2011.581195&amp;#10;9. Transition Regret: https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1743609518300572&amp;#10;10. Dispelling Myths Around Detransition: https://www.stonewall.org.uk/about-us/news/dispelling-myths-around-detransition&amp;#10;11. ACOG Guidance: https://www.acog.org/clinical/clinical-guidance/committee-opinion/articles/2011/12/health-care-for-transgender-individuals&amp;#10;12. Planned Parenthood Guide for Becoming A More Inclusive Healthcare Facility/Provider: https://www.plannedparenthood.org/files/4414/0606/9716/PPSFL_Providing_Transgender_Inclusive_Healthcare_Handbook.pdf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;** The information in this video is intended to serve as educational information and is not intended or implied to be a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. All content, including text, graphics, images, and information, contained in this video is for general information purposes only and does not replace a consultation with your own doctor/advanced practice provider. **&amp;#10;&amp;#10;++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++"
