    title "Gold medallist Emily Seebohm  on transgender athletes"
    description "The peak body for swimming, FINA, has made a historic decision to effectively ban most transgender women from participating in female competitions.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Three-time Olympic gold medallist Emily Seebohm says she is &amp;#8220;happy to finally we have a decision&amp;#8221; on transgender athletes as it allows swimmers to see where the sport will be going in the future.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8220;I&amp;#8217;m really supportive of the open category that they are suggesting that they are going to bring into competition,&amp;#8221; she told Sky News Australia.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8220;It gives a chance for everyone to be involved in our sport, I love my sport I want to share it with everyone so let&amp;#8217;s get everyone involved and let&amp;#8217;s just keep it fair.&amp;#8221;"
