    description "In this video, we will take a look at what I personally consider to be the best transgender films. For this list, I will be exploring my favorite films that prominently feature transgender or gender-questioning characters and/or documentary subjects. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Feel free to SUBSCRIBE.&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/styleissubstance&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;Twitter: https://twitter.com/SubstanceIs&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Letterboxd: https://letterboxd.com/Jay96/&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; e-mail: styleissubstance1@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Chapters:&amp;#10;0:00:00 &amp;#8212; Intro&amp;#10;0:01:31 &amp;#8212; 22. WOMEN IN REVOLT (1971, Paul Morrissey)&amp;#10;0:05:55 &amp;#8212; 21. GLEN OR GLENDA (1953, Edward D. Wood Jr.)&amp;#10;0:10:37 &amp;#8212; 20. MY LIFE IN PINK (1997, Alain Berliner)&amp;#10;0:13:39 &amp;#8212; 19. THE LAW OF DESIRE (1987, Pedro Almod&amp;#243;var)&amp;#10;0:17:07 &amp;#8212; 18. SE&amp;#209;ORITA (2011, Isabel Sandoval)&amp;#10;0:20:29 &amp;#8212; 17. I DON'T KNOW (1971, Penelope Spheeris)&amp;#10;0:22:56 &amp;#8212; 16. A FANTASTIC WOMAN (2017, Sebasti&amp;#225;n Lelio)&amp;#10;0:25:34 &amp;#8212; 15. THE CRYING GAME (1992, Neil Jordan)&amp;#10;0:29:13 &amp;#8212; 14. BAD EDUCATION (2004, Pedro Almod&amp;#243;var)&amp;#10;0:32:26 &amp;#8212; 13. TOMBOY (2011, C&amp;#233;line Sciamma)&amp;#10;0:34:36 &amp;#8212; 12. JURASSIC PARK (1993, Steven Spielberg)&amp;#10;0:38:20 &amp;#8212; 11. ALL ABOUT MY MOTHER (1999, Pedro Almod&amp;#243;var)&amp;#10;0:41:47 &amp;#8212; 10. SHINJUKU BOYS (1995, Kim Longinotto and Jano Williams)&amp;#10;0:45:42 &amp;#8212; 09. LET THE RIGHT ONE IN (2008, Thomas Alfredson)&amp;#10;0:48:48 &amp;#8212; 08. PARIS IS BURNING (1990, Jennie Livingston)&amp;#10;0:52:07 &amp;#8212; 07. LINGUA FRANCA (2019, Isabel Sandoval)&amp;#10;0:55:36 &amp;#8212; 06. BOYS DON'T CRY (1999, Kimberly Peirce)&amp;#10;0:59:19 &amp;#8212; 05. DOG DAY AFTERNOON (1975, Sidney Lumet)&amp;#10;1:04:05 &amp;#82