    title "Four Myths About #Transgender Athletes, Debunked. Upholding #Trans Athletes Rights ... #shorts"
    description "&amp;#129300; - Four Myths About #Transgender Athletes, Debunked. Upholding #trans athletes' rights requires rooting #out the inaccurate beliefs underlying harmful policies. - Chase Strangio &amp;#38; Gabriel Arkles - https://tinyurl.com/27c5uhpt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10067; - What's #DwhellOnIt?&amp;#10;&amp;#128064; - Dwhell On It is a series where I answer your questions about my lived experience as a #transgender woman!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8252;&amp;#65039; - Get engaged!&amp;#10;&amp;#10133; - Subscribe for more episodes &amp;#38; similar content! -&amp;#160;https://tinyurl.com/2eup8exm&amp;#10;&amp;#9993;&amp;#65039; - Comment w/ thoughts &amp;#38; questions!&amp;#10;&amp;#128077;&amp;#127995; - Please like &amp;#38; share!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128279; - Links!&amp;#10;International #Olympic Committee Framework on Fairness, Inclusion &amp;#38; Non-Discrimination based on #Gender Identity and Sex Variations - https://tinyurl.com/4wwssdr7&amp;#10;Kentucky banned #trans kids from #sports to keep this 12-year-old girl from playing #hockey - http://tinyurl.com/bdzzxvbm&amp;#10;#Gender Verification in the #Olympics - https://tinyurl.com/2p8dnwdj&amp;#10;Genital inspection provision to be removed from Ohio #transgender #athlete ban - https://tinyurl.com/2p9v6jcc&amp;#10;#Canada is the first country to provide census data on #transgender &amp;#38; #nonbinary #people. - https://tinyurl.com/yrapfkmn&amp;#10;@Rugby Canada Provides Update on Feedback to #Transgender Athletes Guidelines - https://tinyurl.com/4948hmrb&amp;#10;@Rugby Canada - #Trans Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/sp3cvyad&amp;#10;Creating Inclusive Environments for #Trans Participants in #Canadian Sport - https://tinyurl.com/2p9hcf6c&amp;#10;The ban violates the #humanrights of #transgender &amp;#38; #gender-diverse women. - @Canadian Women &amp;#38; Sport and @Canadian Centre for Ethics in Sport / CCES - https://tinyurl.com/4hrhbvf7&amp;#10;@International Rugby League Bans #Transgender Women from Participating - https://tinyurl.com/yc56pb6y&amp;#10;@Canada Rugby League Association Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/2aush2cp&amp;#10;@U SPORTS Approves Inclusive New Policy For #Transgender Student-Athletes - http://tinyurl.com/yc5ebr4w&amp;#10;Policy on Eligibility for The Men's &amp;#38; Women's Competition Categories - https://tinyurl.com/yt7nj688&amp;#10;Homeless rates for 2SLGBTQIA+ teens are alarming, but #parents can make a difference. - https://tinyurl.com/4u62mj9k&amp;#10;2022 National Survey on 2SLGBTQIA+ Youth #MentalHealth - https://tinyurl.com/4abafnsb&amp;#10;A study shows #transgender youth have high parental support but lack access to #care. - https://tinyurl.com/3wecjr9y&amp;#10;What do pubertal blockers do? - https://tinyurl.com/4v7tm2pa&amp;#10;#Transgender Youth Referred to Clinics for #Gender-Affirming #Medical #Care in #Canada - https://tinyurl.com/yusabpxn&amp;#10;#Trans #healthcare in #Canada needs significant improvements. - https://tinyurl.com/2zz5msnj&amp;#10;My Call to Action for #Trans Day of Visibility! - http://tinyurl.com/54u5wxkk&amp;#10;Definition of &amp;#34;fairness&amp;#34; (noun) - https://tinyurl.com/ytn62frb&amp;#10;Tommy Tuberville's Pathetic Attempt to Attack #Transgender Kids Nationwide Fails. - https://tinyurl.com/t2fectej&amp;#10;#Trans #people face growing backlash, high violence, discrimination &amp;#38; poverty levels. - https://tinyurl.com/2s4hestz&amp;#10;Experiences of violent victimization and unwanted sexual behaviours among gay, #lesbian, #bisexual &amp;#38; other sexual minority #people and the #transgender population - https://tinyurl.com/2rsaa2mp&amp;#10;A statistical portrait of #Canada's diverse 2SLGBTQIA+ communities. https://tinyurl.com/3k2t7pvv&amp;#10;@FINA1908 votes to restrict #trans participation in elite women's competition. - https://tinyurl.com/4u89rwk4&amp;#10;@Sport Canada funds many organizations that nationally represent #Canada's #sports system through the Sport Support Program. - https://tinyurl.com/mtt7b6vd&amp;#10;@Water Polo Canada Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/35cua7fr&amp;#10;@Swimming Canada - #Equity, Diversity &amp;#38; Inclusion - https://tinyurl.com/yc3nutef&amp;#10;@Diving Canada - #Equity, Diversity &amp;#38; Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/a2j8psfn&amp;#10;@Canada Artistic Swimming #Equity, Diversity &amp;#38; Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/5n6s22xw&amp;#10;@Sport Canada discontinues survey on inclusion after complaints of discrimination toward #transgender athletes. - https://tinyurl.com/2p8ds2pd&amp;#10;Let's Talk About #Sports, Emm Bee! - http://tinyurl.com/44xn76r2.&amp;#10;Does @Sport Manitoba Fund Non-Inclusive PSOs? - http://tinyurl.com/44xn76r2&amp;#10;#Canada's #government provides updates &amp;#38; announces action about safe sport. - https://tinyurl.com/m8u4p3rc&amp;#10;From the London Declaration - &amp;#34;Expectations for Fairness in Sport.&amp;#34; - https://tinyurl.com/3678d7ds&amp;#10;Red Deer Declaration - For the Prevention of Harassment, Abuse &amp;#38; Discrimination in Sport - https://tinyurl.com/2p8uyhzm&amp;#10;Allyship as #activism: advancing #social #change in global sport through transformational allyship. - https://tinyurl.com/ym6wt98c&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128113;&amp;#127996;&amp;#8205;&amp;#9792;&amp;#65039; - Look me up!&amp;#10;@TaylorLakhryst: #Transgender woman, advocate, INFJ, &amp;#9802;&amp;#65039;, she/her/hers &amp;#127987;&amp;#65039;&amp;#8205;&amp;#9895;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;Linktree:&amp;#160;https://linktr.ee/TaylorLakhryst&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#IOC #FINA #CCES #active #anxiety #athlete #college #culture #donate #education #environment #equality #features #help #heritage #justice #leaders #LGBT #LGBTQ #news #out #parenting #perspective #press #respect #science #swim #swimming #therapy #water #healthylifestyle #humanrights"
